  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 14th April 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 14th April 2026 and numbered LP1, 686-SP1, 686-L1, 686-L2, 686-L3 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class B Clause B.1 (f) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the dwelling is located on article 2(3) land, within Osterley Park Conservation Area. Planning Permission is therefore required.\r\n"
